WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:10:00.000 line:-4
CUE 1 of 4. cue-probe-line.vtt, the SAME cues as cue-probe.vtt with one variable added: line:-4 on every timing line.

00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:06.000 line:-4
CUE 2 of 4, three seconds in. Only an element whose clock advances ever reaches this one.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:09.000 line:-4
CUE 3 of 4, six seconds in.

00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:12.000 line:-4
CUE 4 of 4, nine seconds in. cues.length reads 4 even when CUE 1 is the only one that ever paints.
